/**
 * Centralized event delegation: primary UI clicks use data-action (no inline onclick).
 * Form controls in index.html use addEventListener via staticHtmlBindings.js after Game boots.
 *
 * Usage (HTML):
 *   <button data-action="saveGame">Save</button>
 *   <button data-action="sortStorage" data-arg="level">Level</button>
 *   <button data-action="selectStarter" data-arg="grass">Grass</button>
 *
 * Actions are registered in ACTION_MAP below.
 * data-arg / data-arg2 / data-arg3 supply up to three positional arguments.
 * data-action-stop marks inner modal surfaces (legacy); clicks are delegated in capture phase
 * so stopPropagation on inner boxes no longer blocks these handlers.
 * data-action-self  passes the clicked element as first arg (replaces `this` in inline handlers).
 *
 * Phase 1.5 — Migrated to facade.dispatch() for all game state mutations.
 * Pure UI actions (DOM toggles, global function calls) remain direct.
 * Phase 5.4 — @ts-nocheck removed, full typing.
 */

